{"version":1,"content":"<p>被喻為新一代女神的藝人甄敏芳（Jenny）原來私下可愛又俏皮，近日她在社交網拍了一條整蠱視頻，她扮不經意掉下紙及筆，當其他藝人撿到後，拿着紙筆追上她時，她隨即跟對方說：「唔好意思，我今日唔簽名。</p><p>」她配文笑言：「今日好多人想搵我攞簽名。</p><p>」片中</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:19.774354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.056743+00:00","content_hash":"2a194b5eaa487ea845626c4cd5e263087ed87d1b78ee1e06842a63b884611392","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}